# Soft admin entity forms (Branch / Org / Court)

Golden paths:

- [`apps/admin-web/components/branches/branch-form.tsx`](apps/admin-web/components/branches/branch-form.tsx)
- [`apps/admin-web/components/organizations/organization-form.tsx`](apps/admin-web/components/organizations/organization-form.tsx)
- [`apps/admin-web/components/courts/court-form.tsx`](apps/admin-web/components/courts/court-form.tsx)

## Required stack

New or edited Soft admin entity create/edit forms **must** use:

1. **`FormProvider`** (react-hook-form) around the form tree
2. **`EntityFormFrame`** — cancel/submit chrome (`actionsPlacement: "inline"` in sheets, `"shell"` on full pages)
3. **`EntityMetadataForm`** + `EntityFormBlock[]` for standard text / select / multi-select fields
4. **`EntityFormSection`** (or `*ContentFields` modules) for complex controls under the same frame

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hand-rolled sheet form chrome
<form>
  <FieldGroup>{/* manual Field stack */}</FieldGroup>
  <div className="border-t …">
    <Button variant="outline" className={softDirectorySecondaryBtn} />
    <Button className={softDirectoryPrimaryBtn} />
  </div>
</form>

// ✅ GOOD
<FormProvider {...form}>
  <EntityFormFrame
    cancelLabel={…}
    submitLabel={…}
    onCancel={…}
    pending={pending}
    onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)}
    actionsPlacement={layout === "sheet" ? "inline" : "shell"}
  >
    <EntityMetadataForm blocks={blocks} />
    <EntitySpecialContentFields />
  </EntityFormFrame>
</FormProvider>
```

## Sheets

Sheet wrappers mirror Branch: `SheetContent` + header + form with `layout="sheet"`. See `branch-form-sheet.tsx` / `court-form-sheet.tsx`.

## Escape hatches (still inside the frame)

Use dedicated sections — **not** a parallel form footer/layout — for:

- WYSIWYG description → `RichTextEditor` + RHF `Controller` (see `BranchContentFields`, `CourtContentFields`)
- Gallery / file upload
- Maps / address pickers
- Image crop / cover

## Do not

- Reinvent cancel/submit footers with `softDirectoryPrimaryBtn` on entity forms (Frame owns actions)
- Flat `FieldGroup` without `EntityFormSection` soft cards for multi-field Soft forms
- Put `*` inside i18n strings — use `required: true` on blocks / `FieldLabel required`

